This '''species''' was a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] that existed in [[the galaxy]].<ref name="The Recruit" />

==Biology and appearance==
This [[humanoid]] [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] was distinguished by their [[Color|purple]] and tan skin. They possessed large builds, with large chins, with pronounced underbites, pointed [[Tooth|teeth]], yellow [[Eye|eyes]], and long, pointed [[Ear|ears]] that stuck out from the sides of their heads.<ref name="The Recruit" />

==Species in the galaxy==
One member of this species was a dock worker aboard the [[supertanker fuel depot]] known as the ''[[Colossus]]''<ref name="The Recruit" /> by [[34 ABY]].<ref name="Date">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]'' establishes that the events of [[Star Wars Resistance Season One|''Star Wars Resistance'' Season One]], which includes this episode, takes place in [[34 ABY]].</ref>

==Behind the scenes==
This species first appeared in the [[The Recruit|premiere episode]] of the [[Star Wars Resistance Season One|first season]] of the ''[[Star Wars Resistance]]'' animated television series,<ref name="The Recruit" /> aired on [[October 7]], [[2018]].<ref name="Air date">{{DisneyPress|wdtv=1|url=disneychannel/shows/star-wars-resistance/episodes|text=Star Wars Resistance}}</ref>

